                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Soul guiding and shadow work to explore your depths, live more fully in your body, and experience new ways of inhabiting the shape that you are."
                    }
                  ]
