            12
          ]
        }
      },
      "style": {
        "colorTheme": "dark"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "blk_e9ewrvx765",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The work"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Everything has value, especially the things we fear most."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "We are all imperfect, but we’re not broken. A lack of access to the buried and denied parts of ourselves contributes to our feelings of numbness, isolation, and fear. It’s these protected and denied parts that hold missing life force, energy that is a powerful resource for our healing, growth, and expansion."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_1gp7cqq8mp",
          "type": "columns",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "items": [
              {
                "body": {
                  "type": "doc",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "A greater breadth and depth of options for how you engage with yourself and the world around you."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "heading": "Access"
              },
              {
                "body": {
                  "type": "doc",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Into the depths and flow with the river of your life."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "heading": "Step"
              },
              {
                "body": {
                  "type": "doc",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "A more soulful, meaningful journey that honors both who you are and who you’re meant to be."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "heading": "Achieve"
              }
            ],
            "columns": "3",
            "aspect": "4:5"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
