                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "A men’s weekend at Elkstone Farm in Steamboat Springs, Colorado, co-led by Jeffrey James, Keith Martin-Smith, Marco Lam and Eddie Konold. Three days of council, fire, embodiment and sitting practice for men ready to claim their purpose in love, work and community."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Elkstone Farm · Steamboat Springs, CO Friday evening – Sunday Next dates: to be announced"
