    {
      "id": "sec_zsvkz2d6k8",
      "preset": "starter/stack-4-4-4@1",
      "layout": {
        "mode": "stack",
        "columns": {
          "d": [
            4,
            4,
            4
          ],
          "m": [
            12
          ]
        }
      },
      "style": {
        "colorTheme": "dark"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "blk_ykcj4r6vrw",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "column": 0,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "I feel more connected to myself: my power, my kindness, my skills in communicating about real issues, feelings, and needs. Jeffrey held the space, participated, and led us in a really skilled, tender, powerful way."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "ADAM M."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_gkwhth8hcv",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "column": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Sitting around the fire and co-creating space to listen and share with our hearts has been one of the most valuable experiences I have committed to, a truly heart opening practice that has cultivated both confidence and humility in me."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "JEFF H."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_jvx4w0b54a",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "column": 2,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The most memorable part of it was in the Kiva, around a fire, connected to something primitive and real. I compare it to sitting among wise council – of curious and interesting men who see possibility for living a greater purpose."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "DAVID B."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
